## 1. CLI Diagnostic & Verification Gates (`PASS` / `FAIL`)

Every verification check below is **binary (`exit 0` = `PASS`, `exit != 0` = `FAIL`)**:

| Gate | Command | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **1. Focused Reproduction** | `{{reproduce_cmd}}` | Reproduce the failure deterministically (`exit != 0` on red, `exit 0` on green) (**D1**, **D8**) |
| **2. Verbose Stack / Locals** | `{{verbose_cmd}}` | Read the full first traceback and local variables without opening an interactive prompt (**D2**) |
| **3. Leftover Debug Sweep** | `{{debug_cleanup_cmd}}` | Prove zero `[DEBUG-xxxx]` tags, debug prints, or breakpoints remain before hand-off (**D11**) |
| **4. Static & Suite Verification** | `{{verify_suite_cmd}}` | Verify linter, type checker, and affected test suite pass after the fix (**D7**, **D8**) |

---

## 2. The 6-Step Debugging Loop

1. **Reproduce (`D1`–`D3`):** Run one non-interactive CLI command that fails reliably with the reported symptom; read the **first** real error down to the first frame in workspace code ([01]({{ref_01}})).
2. **Minimize & Isolate (`D4`, `D13`):** Strip non-essential inputs, diff against the last green revision, trace callers (`rg -n` / code intelligence), or bisect in a disposable worktree ([01]({{ref_01}}), [02]({{ref_02}})).
3. **Hypothesize (`D5`, `D6`):** Write 3–5 ranked falsifiable hypotheses (`H1`..`H3`), test one variable at a time, and trace the bad value backwards to its origin ([02]({{ref_02}})).
4. **Fix & Regression Test (`D7`–`D9`, `D11`):** Turn the minimal case into a Red-to-Green regression test (`{{unit_testing_link}}`), apply the smallest fix at the owning layer (`{{clean_architecture_link}}`), and remove all `[DEBUG-xxxx]` logs ([03]({{ref_03}})).
5. **Stop & Escalate (`D10`, `D12`):** Report environment failures as `BLOCKED`, missing context as `NEEDS_CONTEXT`, stop after **3 failed fix attempts**, and route contract/schema/scope changes to `change-control` ([03]({{ref_03}})).
6. **Report (`D14`):** Record Symptom, Triage, Reproduction, Root cause, Fix, Regression Red/Green rows, Ruled-out hypotheses, and Debug-tag cleanup proof ([03]({{ref_03}})).

